      "value": "@{5af78181852432465920134e|full_name}: \n\"if they do these things online, they will be caught\" - I very much doubt that, VRChat has too many players and rooms for any team to moderate all of them, Someone trying to reverse engineer VRChat could just setup a private world and they will probably be fine, also given how easy it is to create an account, even if they do get caught, they can just start again with a new account.\n\"Its just setting up more work for a dev team that could be working on new features\", Self hosting would be a new feature, One i think it would be well worth the time and effort.",
