      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "1.) Private groups can moderate their own server rooms, VRC just pushed liability elsewhere ( this is great for VRC staff as they can continue to focus on features )\n2.) Maybe have a bridge that connects your Discord account and the worlds that you have linked to it, no one else can join unless in those groups\n3.) Yes, this gives rise to issues, it solves others, that's just the nature of the beast in reality.\n4.) I have yet to find an MMO, that doesn't have some kind of 18+ content generated by the user base ( im not asking for proof or examples, this is just a statement ).\n5.) EULA for server hosting would include a liability clause on the HOST ( configuring users) part.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
